---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/TextPage.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Garanty Studios"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}

	<p>Hi there!</p>
	<p>Garanty Studios is an indie game development and publishing studio based in Germany. Our most popular titles include <i>A NOT Troll Game</i>, <i>Coloring</i>, and <i>Archive of Tales</i>.</p>
	<p>Myk, the studio's founder, owner, and main developer, creates and publishes games with one goal in mind: bringing fun to players around the globe.</p>
	<p>On July 13th, <i>A NOT Troll Game</i>, which had been available in beta for a year, was officially released on Steam. We celebrate this date as the anniversary of ANTG, but it's also the heart of our studio!</p>
	<p>Come check out our social media or explore our game pages if you're interested. After all, everyone deserves to have fun!</p>

</Layout>

